=== a domain script where core isn't beside it: refused plainly
$ sh <S>/lonely/trackers/scripts/main/context-add-issue.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-installed --url https://github.com/cli/cli/issues/1
    context-add-issue.sh: core's context isn't beside this skill (expected <S>/lonely/crucible-context); install first
    [exit 2]
$ sh <R>/domains/software-development/core/main-thread/code-context/scripts/main/context-add-commit.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-installed --repo <S>/repo --ref HEAD
    context-add-commit.sh: core's context isn't beside this skill (expected <R>/domains/software-development/core/main-thread/crucible-context); install first
    [exit 2]
